# Runs and cached data are reproducible outputs, not source.
runs/
data_cache/
data_csv/
# ledger/ (paper.ledger_path) is deliberately NOT listed here -- it is the paper-trading
# audit trail and must be git-tracked so it survives a stateless CI runner between
# scheduled jobs (live/ledger.py, Phase 5). Unlike runs/, this is real state, not
# regenerable output.
# The earnings calendar and supply_chain_links.csv are user-edited input worth keeping in
# history; the risk-free series and the industry-cycle series are reproducible downloads,
# so they are not.
config/risk_free_3m.csv
data/external/IPG3344S.csv

